Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

vendor/cab/
    A vendored copy of the `cab` crate (https://github.com/mdsteele/rust-cab),
    licensed under the MIT License. Upstream's LICENSE file is retained in that
    directory. Openote applies a documented two-method patch
    (FileEntry::uncompressed_offset, Cabinet::read_folder_data) enabling
    single-pass LZX folder extraction; both additions are marked
    "(Openote patch)" in the source. See vendor/cab/OPENOTE-PATCH.md.

