Reverse-engineering provenance
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The OneNote import path (src/onenote.rs, src/onepkg.rs) implements Microsoft's
published [MS-ONESTORE] and [MS-ONE] open specifications. During development it
was cross-checked against `onenote.rs`
(https://github.com/msiemens/onenote.rs), an independent third-party reference
implementation licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0.

That project is a *reference consulted*, not a dependency: no MPL-2.0 code is
copied into or linked by this crate, and it is not vendored here. It is recorded
explicitly so the provenance of the format knowledge is unambiguous, and so that
the MPL-2.0 code and this Apache-2.0 crate are never confused for one another.
